{"type": "Gene", "schema_version": "1.13.0", "id": "gene_manual_438719a5", "category": "repair", "signals_match": ["fs.readFileSync", "encoding-error"], "strategy": ["AVOID: assume-default-utf8 (file). FIX: 用 encoding='gbk' 打开（中文 Windows 日志/CSV 默认 GBK，勿按 utf-8 读）；切勿用 errors='ignore' 强吞（会丢字形）；文件无 BOM 时不要用 utf-8-sig。"], "constraints": {"max_files": 12, "forbidden_paths": [".git", "node_modules"]}, "validation": [], "summary": "encoding-error 失败（读取 Windows 中文环境生成的日志/CSV） [AVOID assume-default-utf8]: UnicodeDecodeError: codec cannot decode byte 0xd5 position 10 (invalid continuat", "generation_meta": {"source": "light-manual-guided"}, "claims": [{"predicate": "output_contract", "kind": "behavioral"}], "scope": {"signals": ["capability:fs.readFileSync", "capability:encoding-error"]}, "asset_id": "sha256:438719a5800fca2fb5dba30caafa13b44388062ff216ed08f0edbd21dfe33000", "shareable": true, "provenance": {"source": "starter-pack", "tier": "official", "contributor": "pi-evox-loop"}}
{"type": "Gene", "schema_version": "1.13.0", "id": "gene_manual_5271726d", "category": "repair", "signals_match": ["json.loads", "invalid-json"], "strategy": ["AVOID: 用严格解析器（json.loads）直接解析非标准 JSON（尾随逗号/注释/BOM）。FIX: 先规范化——剥注释与尾随逗号，或用 tolerant 解析（如 json5）；切勿静默 try/except 吞掉解析错误导致后续用错数据。"], "constraints": {"max_files": 12, "forbidden_paths": [".git", "node_modules"]}, "validation": [], "summary": "invalid-json 失败（解析第三方接口返回的非标准 JSON（尾随逗号/注释）） [AVOID strict-parse-no-fallback]: JSONDecodeError: Expecting property name enclosed in double quotes: line 1 colum", "generation_meta": {"source": "light-manual-guided"}, "claims": [{"predicate": "output_contract", "kind": "behavioral"}], "scope": {"signals": ["capability:json.loads", "capability:invalid-json"]}, "asset_id": "sha256:5271726d0abcf633c2a2fd322918a7483a8d32ec88fbc543264960590f138dd0", "shareable": true, "provenance": {"source": "starter-pack", "tier": "official", "contributor": "pi-evox-loop"}, "anti_patterns": []}
{"type": "Gene", "schema_version": "1.13.0", "id": "gene_manual_c871c982", "category": "repair", "signals_match": ["fs.writeFileSync", "permission-denied"], "strategy": ["AVOID: 直接向只读路径（0444）写入而不先恢复写权限。FIX: 先 chmod u+w <文件> 再写，写后按需 chmod u-w 还原；或用临时文件写后原子替换（写 tmp + rename）；切勿用 sudo 强行写。"], "constraints": {"max_files": 12, "forbidden_paths": [".git", "node_modules"]}, "validation": [], "summary": "permission-denied 失败（向 0444 只读配置文件写入） [AVOID write-without-restore-perm]: Error: EPERM: operation not permitted, open '/etc/app/config.json'", "generation_meta": {"source": "light-manual-guided"}, "claims": [{"predicate": "output_contract", "kind": "behavioral"}], "scope": {"signals": ["capability:fs.writeFileSync", "capability:permission-denied"]}, "asset_id": "sha256:c871c98288bda8b45eb3f55894ec53e8527bc699c8ae46466a801005a594576b", "shareable": true, "provenance": {"source": "starter-pack", "tier": "official", "contributor": "pi-evox-loop"}, "anti_patterns": []}
